#11901
Entry Chamber~
   This room is designed as the entry into the crypt. It is made of marble,
and has faded paintings depicting some of Lothar's lesser deeds, along the
walls. Two marble benches are here, one along each wall, to allow those who
would come and pay their respects to Lothar the chance to rest and compose
themselves before they continue.
~
