#11902
The Grand Hall~
   This room is decked out as a great banquet hall; a place for Lothar and his
noble companions to have great feasts in the afterlife. There is a long table
in the center of the room with twelve stout, wooden chairs. The table and
chairs are all lavishly decorated with carvings of wild game. The walls
contain displays of weapons and shields. The displays are old and rusting,
and it is obvious that there is nothing of any value here.
~
