#11914
Spiritwood~
   You stand within the dark forest, straining to see between the thick
trees that surround you. As you walk through, brushing by the dry, dead
leaves, your foot strikes a hard surface beneath. Brushing away the leaves,
you find a metal grate buried beneath the leaves and twigs.
